  "limitations": [
    "The review was limited to studies with participants of a certain age bracket (undergraduate university level), and/or race and/or geographical location.",
    "All included studies lacked variance in cultural background and age groups of participants.",
    "The limited number of studies and methodological inconsistencies prevented a meta-analysis.",
    "The review focused on interior spaces due to difficulty controlling external factors, which limits generalizability to exterior environments."
  ],
